ELAM EBOW            = (nonsense) [magic mapping]
ELBIB YLOH           = Holy Bible [genocide]
FOOBIE BLETCH        = Computer hacker's words FOO and BLETCH
GARVEN DEH           = (nonsense)
HACKEM MUCHE         = Pidgin English for "Hack Much." [damage weapon]
JUYED AWK YACC       = UNIX: ED (editor) AWK(string proc) YACC (parcer builder)
                       [destroy armor]
KERNOD WEL           = Scottish "Kenned" (known) -> Known Well  [identify]
KIRJE                = "A LETTER" in Finnish [mail]
LEP GEX VEN ZEA      = (nonsense) [create monster]
NR 9                 = Beatles' 'Revolution Number 9'  [confuse monster]
PRATYAVAYAH          = Hindu (?) word (Book?) [remove curse]
PRIRUTSENIE          = Russian "prirutchenie" = taming [taming]
READ ME              = Common software document name [blank paper]
TEMOV                = Vomet (???).
THARR                = There's gold in them THARR hills. [gold detection]
VE FORBRYDERNE       = beware, criminals! (danish) [punishment]
VELOX NEB            = (nonsense)
VENZAR BORGAVVE      = (nonsense) [teleportation]
VERR YED HORRE       = (nonsense) [light]
XIXAXA XOXAXA XUXAXA = X's -> H's HiHaHa! HoHaha! HuHaHa! [scare monster]
YUM YUM              = Hungry sounds. [food detection]
ZELGO MER            = (nonsense) [enchant armor]

